      "source_provenance": "Tan et al., J. Alloys Comp. 742 (2018) 430-436, Table 1 (and Ye et al., Materials Today 19 (2016) 349).",
      "generation_method": "Extracted from the published supplementary material and embedded inline as a list of {alloy_name, true_phase} objects.",
